{"unit_id":"mutoharohfiqhiabcd-source__dsh-lead-panel#feature-1","repo":"mutoharohfiqhiabcd-source/dsh-lead-panel","commit":"0baf5498ca8e8189fd8e62f9a7de682bc2727ea4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Lead Panel 的功能「面板入口」：在网页对话输入区左侧注册“领导”按钮，点击后打开面板。面板提供需求输入、状态、计划、工人和用量展示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:900-912"]}
{"unit_id":"mutoharohfiqhiabcd-source__dsh-lead-panel#feature-2","repo":"mutoharohfiqhiabcd-source/dsh-lead-panel","commit":"0baf5498ca8e8189fd8e62f9a7de682bc2727ea4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Lead Panel 的功能「领导会话」：创建或恢复专用领导会话，用户可发送消息或请求领导总结需求并派活；状态保存在 DSH 数据目录，供重启后恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:772-800","index.js:830-870"]}
{"unit_id":"mutoharohfiqhiabcd-source__dsh-lead-panel#feature-3","repo":"mutoharohfiqhiabcd-source/dsh-lead-panel","commit":"0baf5498ca8e8189fd8e62f9a7de682bc2727ea4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Lead Panel 的功能「跨平台协作」：选择分工、会诊或流水线并勾选 DSH、Codex、Claude Code 平台；会诊并行执行，流水线按顺序将上一步结果传给下一步。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:225-270"]}
{"unit_id":"mutoharohfiqhiabcd-source__dsh-lead-panel#feature-4","repo":"mutoharohfiqhiabcd-source/dsh-lead-panel","commit":"0baf5498ca8e8189fd8e62f9a7de682bc2727ea4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Lead Panel 的功能「模型切换和打开平台」：查看 DSH provider 模型，并切换领导模型；外部 harness 可查看或修改原生模型配置，也可打开平台或配置文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:697-725"]}
{"unit_id":"mutoharohfiqhiabcd-source__dsh-lead-panel#feature-5","repo":"mutoharohfiqhiabcd-source/dsh-lead-panel","commit":"0baf5498ca8e8189fd8e62f9a7de682bc2727ea4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Lead Panel 的功能「用量统计」：面板显示 token、估算金额、耗时、预计剩余时间和速度；外部 harness 工人不回传 token，因此相关统计不包含它们。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-25","lib/client.js:870-900"]}
